        <div class="panel-body">
            <h3>About This List</h3><p>This list has been compiled by members of the Capacity Building Working Group in collaboration with key education providers. Requests for additions or amendments to the listing should be submitted to&nbsp;<a href="mailto:climateforum@centralbank.ie">climateforum@centralbank.ie</a>.</p><h3>Disclaimer</h3><p>Centralbank.ie provides a list of third-party courses for informational purposes only. </p><p>Central Bank of Ireland is not the provider of these courses and does not endorse, warrant, or make any representations regarding the quality, accuracy, completeness, or suitability of the information provided, or the courses themselves. Course content, availability, and other details may be subject to change without notice.</p><p>Any decision to enrol in or engage with a course is made at the users own discretion and constitutes a direct arrangement solely between the user and the relevant course provider. Central Bank of Ireland accepts no liability for any loss, damage, or inconvenience arising in connection with the use of this information or participation in any course.</p>
        </div>
